# cmd.exe mis-parses labels/goto in LF-only batch files, so the launcher is
# stored with CRLF in the repo itself (-text: no EOL conversion). "text
# eol=crlf" is not enough: it normalises the blob to LF and only converts on
# checkout, so raw.githubusercontent.com (the WINDOWS.md download) serves LF.
launcher/mdl-demo.cmd -text
